<title>USA: Weekly broiler/egg report -- USDA.</title>
<headline>Weekly broiler/egg report -- USDA.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-09-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Placements of broiler chicks in the 15 major producing states in the week ended Sept 7 totalled 132.615 million, versus a revised 133.822 million in the previous week and 130.447 million a year ago, the U.S. Agriculture Department said.</p>
<p>Eggs set in those states in the same week totalled 164.010 million, versus a revised 164.549 million the previous week and 157.422 million in the comparable week of last year, USDA said.</p>
</text>
